er)","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","origin":null}},{"id":"Q379761","ar":"كركي متوج","sci":"Balearica pavonina","en":"Black Crowned Crane","iucn":"VU","wdrev":2549043079,"head":"كركي","root":"ك ر ك","arwiki":{"title":"كركي متوج أسود","rev":76374336,"text":["كركي متوج أسود أو غُرْنُوق أسود أو غِرْنِيق أسود (الاسم العلمي: Balearica  pavonina) هو طائر ينتمي إلى الفصيلة الكركية (فصيلة: Gruidae)."]},"enwiki":"Black crowned crane","image":{"file":"Венценосный журавль I.jpg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/%D0%92%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%86%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%B6%D1%83%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%BB%D1%8C_I.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/%D0%92%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%86%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%B6%D1%83%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%BB%D1%8C_I.jpg/960px-%D0%92%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%86%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%B6%D1%83%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%BB%D1%8C_I.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D0%92%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%86%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%B6%D1%83%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%BB%D1%8C_I.jpg","author":"Rigelus","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","origin":null},"audio":null,"audioFromSearch":false,"video":{"file":"Balearica pavonina2.ogv","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3b/Balearica_pavonina2.ogv","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Balearica_pavonina2.ogv/120px--Balearica_pavonina2.ogv.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Balearica_pavonina2.ogv","author":"Raul654","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","origin":null}},{"id":"Q335992","ar":"كركي متوج رمادي","sci":"Balearica regulorum","en":"Grey Crowned Crane","iucn":null,"wdrev":2550503744,"head":"كركي","root":"ك ر ك","arwiki":{"title":"كركي متوج أرمد","rev":65613976,"text":["كركي متوج أرمد